  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-sans max-w-md mx-auto bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-950 rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200 relative shadow-xl m-4\">\n  <div class=\"text-center space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-5xl\">🏡🔑🍕🍷</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-emerald-600 tracking-wider uppercase font-bold\">Chá de Casa Nova</span>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-emerald-950 tracking-tight\">Open House S/A</h1>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-800 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto\">\n      Cada azulejo, cada móvel e cada pedaço de parede foi planejado com muito amor por <strong class=\"text-emerald-900\">{{nome_moradores}}</strong>! Venha brindar o nosso novo lar com pizza e diversão!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-4 border-y border-emerald-200 py-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-emerald-600 uppercase\">Nosso Brunch</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950 font-bold\">{{dia_open}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-emerald-600 uppercase\">Hora de Entrada</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950 font-bold\">{{hora_open}} hs</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-emerald-100/50 p-3 rounded-lg text-xs border border-emerald-200\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-emerald-600 uppercase\">Endereço da nossa nova chave</span>\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-emerald-900\">{{local_casa}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-white/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/50 text-left text-xs space-y-1\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-emerald-600 uppercase text-center font-bold\">Ideia de Lembranças 🎁</span>\n      <p class=\"text-emerald-800 text-center text-[11px]\">{{lista_mimos}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"inline-block bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-2 px-5 rounded shadow-lg cursor-pointer\">\n        Confirmar no WhatsApp: {{whats_confirmar}}\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
